      }
    ],
    "releaseDate": "11/16/2026",
    "description": "Collects patch compliance: upgradable package count (security vs total where distinguishable), days since the last successful apt/dnf transaction (from package-manager history logs), and the distro release. Emits JSON events to index=main (sourcetype patch:status) and patch.* metrics to index=metrics (sourcetype patch:metrics) hourly, with dashboards.",
